{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As governor, how you build and govern will shape your story, your citizens\u2019 destiny, and your provinces\u2019 future. Will you cooperate with other governors or prove your military prowess by challenging your rivals? The cost of peace is yours to decide. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE THE PREMIER BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your provinces with unmatched detail, flexibility, and scale. Watch kids chase dogs through the streets or thousands cheer in the arena. Build upon the land that you see, from the beautiful heartland of Latium to the mysterious Celtic wetlands of Albion\u2026 where no civilized Roman wants to be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/7c68f7d5e4873baa9f7b0fa7a7864eeb.poster.avif?t=1771959639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/7c68f7d5e4873baa9f7b0fa7a7864eeb.webm?t=1771959639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A ROMAN GOVERNOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the cities of your dreams at the peak of the Roman Empire as you balance your people's needs with the relentless demands of the emperor. Forge alliances across the empire or showcase your might with strategic land battles and naval combat. You may even defy the emperor himself \u2013 but not without consequences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/abd1cb1284bdbdeff1f82f1a5f5199da.poster.avif?t=1771959639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/abd1cb1284bdbdeff1f82f1a5f5199da.webm?t=1771959639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE THE FATE OF YOUR PROVINCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make as governor matters. Will you honor local Celtic culture or enforce Roman traditions? Grow your provinces through diplomacy and commerce or conquer through military strength. Your choices will shape not only the future of your citizens and your provinces, but your own story as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/871a74ddccf6a943abf926e4090d8db3.poster.avif?t=1771959639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/871a74ddccf6a943abf926e4090d8db3.webm?t=1771959639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ab Initio Anno","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/365cdf5bd7c3773a857d27665d82299fce798b10.jpg"},{"name":"Experto Crede","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/845b1913751398dcb7d81ed1d2a2ecf365a3446f.jpg"},{"name":"Terra Nova","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/914f2cfedd96f2adc176517feddb74e7f6f651bd.jpg"},{"name":"Orbis Non Sufficit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/dc0079d071d90787ea027cf6edc82f25394a5fa6.jpg"},{"name":"A Toe In The Caldarium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/66680077e00f03a20e77535c34d875765781c6ad.jpg"},{"name":"Pecunia Non Olet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/e81ec171e93c8ac74383d36466755e2eeed5de14.jpg"},{"name":"Aqueduct Vitae","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/2010514e6aedc1031fdbb9b3657e35d0d8e11dc9.jpg"},{"name":"Haec Ornamenta Mea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/b20e92cb414fae1ca26033861331b3382a666a67.jpg"},{"name":"Trade Union","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/69f734af6ee2266192ce29033d06f5841a108a7e.jpg"},{"name":"De Novo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274580/652f378b01076b0236eb62e9e30e6df51dedcc85.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274580?t=1771959639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274580?t=1771959639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/2a50b884fd1739a68165fc41af8130197f6c57a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771959639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/2a50b884fd1739a68165fc41af8130197f6c57a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771959639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Comparative Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/2a66215b4cad92908a8cd8eca8583b8f.avif?t=1771959639\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/d65b5d8409a6f115d54021aa46a8f380.avif?t=1771959639\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Gold Edition, gain access to the Anno 117: Pax Romana base adventure and expand your reach to new provinces with the Year 1 Pass \u2013 containing 3 DLCs and 5 cosmetic bonuses!</p></p><br><h1>PC Specs</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/0868ef84b13bca9c2c242596afef01b5.avif?t=1771959639\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras_big/0868ef84b13bca9c2c242596afef01b5.webp?t=1771959639 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As governor, how you build and govern will shape your story, your citizens\u2019 destiny, and your provinces\u2019 future. Will you cooperate with other governors or prove your military prowess by challenging your rivals? The cost of peace is yours to decide. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE THE PREMIER BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your provinces with unmatched detail, flexibility, and scale. Watch kids chase dogs through the streets or thousands cheer in the arena. Build upon the land that you see, from the beautiful heartland of Latium to the mysterious Celtic wetlands of Albion\u2026 where no civilized Roman wants to be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/7c68f7d5e4873baa9f7b0fa7a7864eeb.poster.avif?t=1771959639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/7c68f7d5e4873baa9f7b0fa7a7864eeb.webm?t=1771959639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A ROMAN GOVERNOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the cities of your dreams at the peak of the Roman Empire as you balance your people's needs with the relentless demands of the emperor. Forge alliances across the empire or showcase your might with strategic land battles and naval combat. You may even defy the emperor himself \u2013 but not without consequences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/abd1cb1284bdbdeff1f82f1a5f5199da.poster.avif?t=1771959639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/abd1cb1284bdbdeff1f82f1a5f5199da.webm?t=1771959639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE THE FATE OF YOUR PROVINCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make as governor matters. Will you honor local Celtic culture or enforce Roman traditions? Grow your provinces through diplomacy and commerce or conquer through military strength. Your choices will shape not only the future of your citizens and your provinces, but your own story as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/871a74ddccf6a943abf926e4090d8db3.poster.avif?t=1771959639\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/extras/871a74ddccf6a943abf926e4090d8db3.webm?t=1771959639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Ubisoft Mainz"],"dlc":[3749050,3874230],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper","ext_user_account_notice":"Ubisoft Account required ","genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274580/88dbcce1c7630e2d4334fa25e835968e57e0ebfe/header.jpg?t=1771959639","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Ubisoft Entertainment. All Rights Reserved. Anno 117, Ubisoft, and the Ubisoft logo are registered or unregistered trademarks of Ubisoft Entertainment in the US and/or other countries.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":84,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/anno-117-pax-romana?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274580/1523245967/f9baebb6f3e44e4929bec9633a8e459144cd150a/1771957432/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771959637","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274580/1523245967/f9baebb6f3e44e4929bec9633a8e459144cd150a/1771957432/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771959637","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274580/1523245967/f9baebb6f3e44e4929bec9633a8e459144cd150a/1771957432/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771959637","id":257293852,"name":"Year 1 Pass Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257293852/87a217c3ecad41e2ad3b618d8a19a8c5d5b7da15/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771959637"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274580/1806865518/61fddb89d3792be4d7b905b897195e728049d052/1764098460/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764100082","dash_h264":"https://video